  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building integrity and impartiality in Ukraine MoD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will build integrity and impartiality in the procurement and human resource management areas in the civilian part of the Ukrainian Ministry of Defence, Ministry of Economic Development and the National Civil Service Agency. The project will also take part in different working groups and committees involved in anti-corruption planning and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
